Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And bring along all your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just never learn, do you? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a boy cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids won't be kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said your tangerine\Nsucks. He what? Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must find the strength\Ninside you to always move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must live through every moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you can smile in the face of\Nit all, that is the greatest dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.51,0:02:43.64,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(2024,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(1983,2024,\1a&H00&)}Live
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.51,0:02:43.64,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(2024,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while I'm in charge those without money\Nwill die now do you understand me you worms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my map!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drew it and you can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A child drew this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring her with us. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I go to trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised not to hurt\Nher if you got your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just borrow her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take her! Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, you don't need to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no more killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of our ships have been sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid our plan to have Nami and\NNojiko escape to the sea was a bad plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines won't bother\Ntrying to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've lost our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy knew that this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her experiences in the Marines taught her\Nwhat all these creatures are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knew that none of us would escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've taken Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know where Arlong and his crew are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're going to\Nsettle right here on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can fight to the death right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or we can take a chance that the\NMarines will someday come to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hope and pray we don't\Nget killed before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Marine Headquarters\Nstands a chance against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they have their hands\Nfull with the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chances that they would come all the\Nway out here for us are as good as zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't just sit\Nhere and abandon Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.81,0:05:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand by and do\Nnothing when a child is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now who else will come fight beside us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to save that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him your favorite life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't quit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should do no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just one of us fights,\Nthey'll blame us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! What? You're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they hurt you any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm joining Arlong's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get to be a navigator and draw maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back Did they threaten to\Ndo something terrible to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me. Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's an Arlong tattoo, not you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They gave me all this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say, don't buy me\Nanything I want. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you if you join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They killed Bellamy in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She died to keep us safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you! Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to live like\NBellemere if it just gets you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellemere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy gave her life so that you\Nand I could go on living together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave us, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never set foot in this village again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could she betray her family like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy was like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami loved Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't Bellamy always say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good things will come your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you continue to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Arlong took me, I watched him sink\Nfive marine ships like they were toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think they'll send anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided I'd do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a deal with Arlong to\Nbuy Cocoyashi Village from...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy Cocoyashi? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a hundred million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I buy the town, we'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all I have to do is\Njoin his crew and draw maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a hundred million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't earn that\Nworking your whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will get that money no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are having a hard enough\Ntime paying their own tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone tries to help\Nme, they'll just get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't it be hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, living with the people\Nwho killed our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just smile every time I see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make a choice like that\Nwhen you're only ten years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard that must have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All to save the village she loves so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever makes Nami suffer\Nis going to hear from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm telling you to stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go around saying\Nthat she's your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're going to become suspicious of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then her eight years of suffering\Nwill have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make it harder than it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.12,0:10:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing there are people who call her\Nfriend only makes the suffering worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate thief? That's right.\NThe only thing this place
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has going for it is plenty\Nof pirates to steal from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm gonna make them pay\Nyou're all cut up yeah i kind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of screwed up but look one\Nmillion Who cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These cups are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will find it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save up, little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time this is filled,\NI'll have my hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taken a while, but\Nonly seven million left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can get that with one more job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this will finally be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong's rule will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi Village will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I think I'll finally be\Nable to smile again. For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do the marines want Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is to lead the way quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hat? Pinwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world did he get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more little job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the pirate thief known as Name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The marine sources have\Nrevealed that you have quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,large sum of treasure that\Nyou've stolen from pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government hereby confiscates\Neverything you've stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is required that\Nyou comply immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to warn you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the leaders\Nof the Arlong Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you mess with me, Arlong\Nwon't sit by quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think\Nyou can intimidate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find the stolen goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think this is what\Nthe Marines should be doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Arlong pirates are murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've destroyed entire cities\Nand you're doing nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's ruling over this island and\Ntrampling over people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd ignore Arlong's atrocities\Nto steal from a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big talk from a filthy criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue the search, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every person on this\Nisland has been waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the Marines to come\Nand help them for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you pass them by and\Ncome here searching for money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colonel, this tangerine orchard\Nseems a little suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing, if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy hands off\NBellamere's Tangerine Orchard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That money's for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That poor girl's money is meant\Nto save Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to take our\Nsalvation away from her? Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mere village representative\Ntalking down to a marine colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, how'd you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always known, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe what you had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I confronted Nojiko about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone has known that\Nyou stayed with the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong pirates so that you\Ncould save the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we all agreed we'd\Nnever tell you that we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever thought the villagers\Nwere placing their hopes on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might never leave his gang\Nfor fear of letting us down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:15:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a minute, just what\Nare you trying to say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that the villagers are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thieves and we should\Narrest every one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he's saying is that every last\None of us is fighting to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to fend for\Nourselves because we can't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rely on support from\Nyou government people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if you're not going to protect our\Nvillage, then get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And be quick about it, or\NArlong will sink your ship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're looking for a hundred million\Nberries here, not a grain of rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know how much there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have a hunch that that's\Nthe amount we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Arlong that sent you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do a pirate's dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a public servant dealing with\Ntheft the way any government worker would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You corrupt marine scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The marine comes due to being\Nnothing but pirate cronies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm impressed you've\Ngathered this much treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The money's all ragged and\Nbloody. No matter. Money's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 % of this is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that. Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko's been shot. By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines. The Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need help with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get away from our island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want it left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather up 100 million\Nberries, then bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do so and I will let your village go,\Nin addition to giving you your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm the kind of fish\Nman who would rather
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,die than break an\Nagreement concerning money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't even care\Nhow long it takes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will honor our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what seems to be the problem,\Noh skilled surveyor of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the sour face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.48,0:20:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those marine maggots you keep on the\Npayroll stole every last berry I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to all that crap about\Ndying before you'd ever break a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it comes to money, bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refresh my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I break a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you've teamed\Nup with the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when did I break that promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you. Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your stolen money got stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That certainly is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a deal is a deal, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't come up\Nwith 100 million berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then both you and your village\Nstay in my possession indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know the terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only 100 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start saving again and\Nyou'll have it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you gonna run out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you do that, I'll kill everyone\Nin that village Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, we agreed we would\Nnever tell you that we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thought all of\Nus were counting on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would be bound by guilt never to leave\Nhis gang for fear of letting us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, running away so soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we chase after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way Nami could just abandon\Nthe lives of all those villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd let go of\Nan asset like Nami that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be cruel, but I'm\Nnot totally heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once she's done charting all the\Nworld's oceans, she'll have her freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty harsh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take decades for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been a hundred\Nyears, wouldn't it be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had enough. Take up arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, please don't do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to live or our\Nstruggles will mean nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't throw your lives away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.26,0:22:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight long years ago, we promised\Nwe wouldn't live our lives in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the pain or humiliation\Nwe endured under Arlong,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We swore to fight the long fight\Nso Nami could meet their demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never intended to\Nkeep their end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, they stole our\Nonly chance at freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.35,0:23:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should make those\Nfilthy fishmen pay for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the years they manipulated\Nthat kind young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.42,0:23:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were always ready to\Nfight those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to show those lousy, stinking\Nfishmen what we're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.40,0:23:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make it back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's nothing compared to back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.56,0:23:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.46,0:23:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to know that\Nthere is no point now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You struggled so hard carrying our\Nlives on your back this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine that\Njoining them must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more painful than being\Nstabbed through the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set yourself free from this village
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.94,0:24:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, do it! What? Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami... Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an exceptional young woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.46,0:24:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.72,0:24:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.24,0:24:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let anyone\Nelse get hurt by these monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.62,0:25:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made up our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.88,0:25:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.76,0:25:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may not win, but we\Nwill give them hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.76,0:25:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlug!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.30,0:26:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.20,0:26:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what's been happening on\Nthis island for the past eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.36,0:26:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.64,0:26:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, you sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.54,0:26:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.62,0:26:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.28,0:26:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.19,0:26:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.84,0:27:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.56,0:27:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.90,0:27:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better keep your hands off my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.68,0:27:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Arlong do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.44,0:27:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.98,0:28:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have business to take\Ncare of with the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.14,0:28:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we finally found out\Nthe truth about Big Sis Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we realized the only thing we could\Ndo was defeat Arlong in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.38,0:28:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we decided to come back\Nhere and challenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then we lost, but only by a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.66,0:28:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't\Nlet you through this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no chance of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.02,0:28:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.30,0:28:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we're waiting for\Nthe arrival of certain men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.62,0:28:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What certain men?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.84,0:28:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.75,0:28:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.18,0:28:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd bet my life on it.?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.76,0:28:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they come to defend our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.80,0:29:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those men can't handle Arlong and\Nhis gang, then there really is no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only for this island,\Nbut for the whole East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the faces of the four men\Nwho are here to change your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earn their images into your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.76,0:29:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.06,0:29:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.97,0:29:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think those two idiots that showed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up earlier are members of\NZoro's little crew? Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.10,0:29:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem too weak for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.92,0:29:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weren't even worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.04,0:30:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.86,0:30:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you is Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watched the sunrise,\NI began to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.58,0:30:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason\Nit's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.24,0:30:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.38,0:30:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those\Nfeelings, get on to come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.54,0:31:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause they're everything I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.64,0:31:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass these arms around my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.12,0:31:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.18,0:31:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way.

